      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON SUNRISE (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (30.32) in a Novice race at this track. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Got the money at her only try from this box. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. OHTANI MAGIC (3) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing eight from 16 starts. Finished in the minors latest when third (30.28) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Solid winning record at this trip. Expected to be in the finish again. WEST ON MICKY (8) was below best last time when fifth but prior to that was a Maiden winner in quick time at this track. Can feature with the right run. URBAN SURF (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
